WEBVTT

00:19.787 --> 00:24.124
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.124 --> 00:28.696
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.696 --> 00:36.470
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.470 --> 00:41.308
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.308 --> 00:52.086
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.086 --> 00:54.188
Mamoritai

00:54.188 --> 00:56.490
Shinjitai

00:56.490 --> 01:00.694
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.694 --> 01:05.099
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.099 --> 01:09.336
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.336 --> 01:12.873
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:12.873 --> 01:21.713
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:30.691 --> 01:34.354
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:36.063 --> 01:37.898
Miss... Keiko...

01:37.898 --> 01:41.168
Let's go together,
Miss Akiko.

01:41.168 --> 01:42.770
Akiko!

01:42.770 --> 01:44.237
Masahiro!

01:45.839 --> 01:47.739
Let's go, Keiko.

01:49.209 --> 01:50.733
Masahiro!

01:52.146 --> 01:53.680
Akiko...

01:53.680 --> 01:57.309
Where are you, Akiko?
It's impossible...

01:57.751 --> 02:00.087
I promised to protect her...

02:00.087 --> 02:01.488
It's impossible.

02:01.488 --> 02:03.479
Akiko!

02:03.624 --> 02:06.787
Stop the Resentment that
Echoes Through Kifune

02:09.129 --> 02:10.687
Akiko...

02:11.899 --> 02:15.869
- Mokkun!
- Masahiro, are you all right?

02:15.869 --> 02:17.938
What about you?
Are you hurt?

02:17.938 --> 02:20.607
I'm fine. They are
just scratches.

02:20.607 --> 02:22.309
I'm worried about Akiko.

02:22.309 --> 02:25.278
They have captured her and
made their escape.

02:28.749 --> 02:31.343
Where exactly did they go?

02:31.685 --> 02:35.222
Give us that girl so that
we can offer her to our master!

02:35.222 --> 02:39.059
My wish will be granted
if I give Miss Akiko to them.

02:39.059 --> 02:41.995
All will be fine after tonight.

02:41.995 --> 02:44.598
Princess Keiko's wish...

02:44.598 --> 02:46.934
The prince that she was
going to marry...

02:46.934 --> 02:50.734
changed his mind and married
another princess instead.

02:51.738 --> 02:55.909
Princess Keiko's grievance...
The bitterness she feels...

02:55.909 --> 02:58.979
A demoness apparently
appears at Kifune nightly,

02:58.979 --> 03:01.106
and strikes a nail
with a hammer.

03:01.515 --> 03:03.617
The demoness of Kifune...

03:03.617 --> 03:05.676
At 2 am in the morning...

03:06.220 --> 03:08.620
The sound of the hammer
striking the nail.

03:09.890 --> 03:11.625
My dream!

03:11.625 --> 03:14.924
The dream of Kifune
that I had recently...

03:15.996 --> 03:18.521
Grandfather abandoned me.

03:28.442 --> 03:30.811
Princess Keiko is the
demoness of Kifune!

03:30.811 --> 03:33.180
Does this mean the demons
are at Kifune too?

03:33.180 --> 03:35.716
It's far away from
crowded towns,

03:35.716 --> 03:38.819
so that's definitely a good
hiding place for them.

03:38.819 --> 03:42.277
But a dragon deity resides in
Kifune, the sacred mountain.

03:42.489 --> 03:46.293
It is a deity which dictates
rain and water.

03:46.293 --> 03:47.928
Now that you mention it...

03:47.928 --> 03:49.930
Yes, I totally agree.

03:49.930 --> 03:53.767
It hasn't rained in almost
two months.

03:53.767 --> 03:56.668
A drought is inevitable
if it doesn't rain soon.

03:57.905 --> 04:01.074
The dragon deity in Kifune
has been sealed.

04:01.074 --> 04:02.543
Princess Keiko's curse...

04:02.543 --> 04:05.379
Her grievance enveloped
the entire Kifune,

04:05.379 --> 04:07.981
and when combined with
the foreign demons' power,

04:07.981 --> 04:09.778
rendered the dragon deity
helpless.

04:12.119 --> 04:14.321
Are you saying that
the demons used...

04:14.321 --> 04:17.484
Princess Keiko's hatred to
seal the deity of Kifune?

04:26.400 --> 04:28.402
That's right, Mokkun.

04:28.402 --> 04:30.771
Princess Keiko and the demons
are at Kifune.

04:30.771 --> 04:33.173
And I believe that Akiko...

04:33.173 --> 04:36.310
is definitely at Kifune
as well. Now then...

04:36.310 --> 04:38.545
Oh! What are you doing?

04:38.545 --> 04:40.714
Well, you're wounded
right now.

04:40.714 --> 04:43.182
I'm fine! Put me down!

04:48.655 --> 04:51.123
Seiryuu, what happened?

04:53.927 --> 04:58.599
Seimei, the foreign demons have
captured Fujiwara no Akiko.

04:58.599 --> 05:00.467
What?!

05:00.467 --> 05:03.570
And how did Masahiro
deal with it?

05:03.570 --> 05:06.139
He and Touda pursued
the demons.

05:06.139 --> 05:09.977
Taiin is trailing the bird
ayakashi and Keiko's spirit.

05:09.977 --> 05:14.014
When Princess Akiko was captured,
what were the shikigami doing?

05:14.014 --> 05:15.649
Watching...

05:15.649 --> 05:19.676
what that apparent heir
of yours is capable of.

05:20.954 --> 05:25.459
Seiryuu, don't harp on
what happened in the past.

05:25.459 --> 05:29.463
It was inevitable. Touda had
not wanted that to happen too.

05:29.463 --> 05:31.798
But you almost lost your life.

05:31.798 --> 05:33.857
You should know that
very well.

05:34.901 --> 05:36.368
Darn!

05:37.437 --> 05:39.740
I'll go after Taiin.

05:39.740 --> 05:42.909
We'll rescue Fujiwara no
Akiko on our own.

05:42.909 --> 05:46.546
Do not overestimate your
useless grandson.

05:46.546 --> 05:49.750
He's not qualified to be
your successor.

05:49.750 --> 05:51.685
Then wait and see...

05:51.685 --> 05:55.455
The power of my grandson,
whom you deny even now.

05:55.455 --> 06:00.193
If you don't wish to follow his
orders, it's all right by me.

06:00.193 --> 06:03.060
I won't stop you. Go!

06:09.870 --> 06:12.236
What is the situation like now?

06:13.040 --> 06:17.010
Why don't you go along
if you really want to know?

06:17.010 --> 06:18.807
I can't do that.

06:19.279 --> 06:22.482
It's my duty to protect you.

06:22.482 --> 06:25.452
I cannot leave you
on your own.

06:25.452 --> 06:27.420
Rikugou...

06:27.954 --> 06:33.160
Abe no Seimei will have no
other heir, but Masahiro.

06:33.160 --> 06:36.596
Touda and I have agreed
on that.

06:37.164 --> 06:40.497
I see. Then I'll believe
in you.

06:45.038 --> 06:46.767
My, my...

06:50.677 --> 06:54.181
Are you all right, Masahiro?
Don't force yourself.

06:54.181 --> 06:56.583
If I don't hurry, Akiko may...

06:56.583 --> 06:59.416
- Akiko may...
- Masahiro...

07:00.620 --> 07:02.522
But it's too far.

07:02.522 --> 07:05.184
At the rate we're going,
we won't be in time.

07:06.960 --> 07:08.552
Akiko...

07:10.597 --> 07:13.395
Hey, Masahiro! Something's
coming towards us!

07:17.137 --> 07:18.900
A carriage?

07:27.781 --> 07:30.272
Oh! Kurumanosuke!

07:31.485 --> 07:33.680
What are you doing here?!

07:34.121 --> 07:36.490
That's right!
Ask Kurumanosuke...

07:36.490 --> 07:39.482
if he could bring us
to Kifune, Mokkun!

07:41.995 --> 07:45.198
- He's here because of that.
- Really?

07:45.198 --> 07:47.801
He learned about what happened
from a minor demon,

07:47.801 --> 07:50.237
and he rushed here
to repay his debt.

07:50.237 --> 07:52.228
I see...

07:53.173 --> 07:55.107
You are a big help,
Kurumanosuke!

07:57.144 --> 07:59.579
This girl is of the
highest quality.

07:59.579 --> 08:02.282
She is a suitable sacrifice
for our master.

08:02.282 --> 08:04.451
A prey like no other...

08:04.451 --> 08:08.855
- The spiritual power she has...
- This long, dark hair...

08:08.855 --> 08:11.585
She's practically made
for our master.

08:13.460 --> 08:15.394
This scent is!

08:19.966 --> 08:21.334
Stay back!

08:21.334 --> 08:25.205
She's wearing the scent
which is able to resist evil.

08:25.205 --> 08:28.074
She can't be offered to
our master in this state.

08:28.074 --> 08:29.743
What should we do, Shun?

08:29.743 --> 08:32.579
Gaku, you don't have
to worry.

08:32.579 --> 08:35.139
Chouda, come here.

08:36.817 --> 08:41.811
You are willing to make
sacrifices for our master, right?

08:42.289 --> 08:45.417
You're truly devoted to
our master. Then...

08:51.465 --> 08:53.033
I see.

08:53.033 --> 08:56.736
An ayakashi's blood can
neutralize the scent's power.

08:56.736 --> 09:01.366
The scent loses its efficacy
once it's contaminated.

09:02.008 --> 09:06.945
Shun, I've just thought of
a game that we can play.

09:22.696 --> 09:26.154
Geez! What's wrong,
Kurumanosuke?

09:28.068 --> 09:30.704
Oh, I see. It's fine then.

09:30.704 --> 09:32.739
What did it say, Mokkun?

09:32.739 --> 09:35.342
A protective barrier has been
set up from here onwards.

09:35.342 --> 09:37.544
And Kurumanosuke is
unable to get past it.

09:37.544 --> 09:39.671
I see...

09:44.584 --> 09:46.552
Kifune Mountain...

09:50.156 --> 09:52.993
Thank you, Kurumanosuke.

09:52.993 --> 09:54.927
We appreciate it.

09:59.933 --> 10:01.628
All right!

10:09.309 --> 10:11.811
There are only seven
nails left.

10:11.811 --> 10:14.481
Once I finish hammering
in all the nails,

10:14.481 --> 10:16.483
the demons will grant
my wish.

10:16.483 --> 10:20.647
And that person will once
again return to my side.

10:24.224 --> 10:28.128
I can't see a single firefly
inside the barrier.

10:28.128 --> 10:30.187
Is this Kifune Mountain?

10:30.997 --> 10:34.434
No. The Kifune Mountain
I know...

10:34.434 --> 10:38.962
is a sacred mountain which
is breezier and less foggy.

10:40.874 --> 10:42.865
It's dark!

10:44.110 --> 10:46.101
What's wrong, Masahiro?

10:49.516 --> 10:53.179
Masahiro... Are you...
scared of the dark?

10:56.923 --> 10:58.857
I'm frightened!

10:59.826 --> 11:03.262
Grandfather, come and
get me quick!

11:03.863 --> 11:05.763
Hurry up!

11:10.136 --> 11:11.738
Mokkun...

11:11.738 --> 11:14.174
Don't be afraid.
It's just the dark.

11:14.174 --> 11:17.735
And... I'm here with you.

11:20.513 --> 11:24.210
Don't cry, Masahiro.
There's nothing to be afraid of.

11:24.918 --> 11:27.785
It's all right.
I'm here with you.

11:27.821 --> 11:31.257
Don't cry, you're not alone.

11:36.262 --> 11:39.459
See? You don't have to be
frightened anymore.

11:40.300 --> 11:42.325
Thank you, Mokkun.

11:46.806 --> 11:50.537
The sound of
Princess Keiko's curse.

11:51.011 --> 11:53.844
It's coming from there.
Akiko...

11:54.547 --> 11:56.310
is waiting...

11:57.183 --> 11:59.719
I'm sorry, Masahiro.

11:59.719 --> 12:02.789
I exposed you to danger...

12:02.789 --> 12:06.626
just because I was only
thinking about myself.

12:06.626 --> 12:09.396
You don't have to
bother about me...

12:09.396 --> 12:13.093
You can open your
eyes now, girl.

12:31.551 --> 12:35.214
- What's that?
- That's the shrine of Kifune?

12:37.257 --> 12:39.555
Someone's over there.

12:44.998 --> 12:47.899
You're one of Kifune's
priests, aren't you...

12:49.769 --> 12:51.634
Masahiro, beware!

12:55.241 --> 12:57.377
- What's going on?
- Masahiro!

12:57.377 --> 12:59.470
There's another one
above you!

13:03.850 --> 13:07.081
They are under the control
of the foreign demons.

13:08.054 --> 13:09.889
Mokkun, stop!

13:09.889 --> 13:12.659
A shikigami can't harm
humans.

13:12.659 --> 13:15.829
You're wrong, Masahiro!
They aren't human...

13:15.829 --> 13:17.854
They're the living dead!

13:19.399 --> 13:22.960
The foreign shadow took over
after they were killed?

13:39.319 --> 13:41.521
Goodbye, demon.

13:41.521 --> 13:44.888
Your comrades will be
joining you soon.

13:49.062 --> 13:50.864
Guren.

13:50.864 --> 13:52.661
Are you all right?

13:53.166 --> 13:55.430
- Let's move on.
- Yeah.

13:59.205 --> 14:04.210
Gaku, the deity of this mountain
must be totally humiliated.

14:04.210 --> 14:07.847
Trapped with his rains after
being forced to submit...

14:07.847 --> 14:10.984
Shun, you don't have
to fear deities.

14:10.984 --> 14:15.182
Deities in charge of a weak
land are not worthy of us.

14:15.555 --> 14:19.425
But you really have
some good ideas.

14:19.425 --> 14:23.919
Our master will definitely be
pleased with the trap we set up.

14:31.971 --> 14:33.996
So you are here, Priest?

14:35.408 --> 14:38.611
She's nearby. Princess Keiko
is around here.

14:38.611 --> 14:41.848
Masahiro, I'll deal with
these guys.

14:41.848 --> 14:44.717
- You go ahead.
- All right.

14:44.717 --> 14:46.912
I'll clear a path for you.

14:52.659 --> 14:55.150
- Go!
- Thanks!

14:56.496 --> 14:58.191
Eliminate!

14:59.566 --> 15:02.101
Wait for me, Akiko!

15:02.101 --> 15:03.898
Now...

15:08.908 --> 15:11.172
I don't have much time.

15:15.882 --> 15:18.646
I'll send you to meet
your doom!

15:22.622 --> 15:24.487
Very soon...

15:25.158 --> 15:28.218
the demons will transform
that loathsome princess...

15:28.761 --> 15:32.697
who stole my prince into
a hateful and hideous creature!

15:40.440 --> 15:42.499
Where is Akiko?

15:43.243 --> 15:45.268
You're going to meddle
in this?

15:46.145 --> 15:48.615
Akiko is up ahead...

15:48.615 --> 15:50.650
In the main temple.

15:50.650 --> 15:53.152
What's wrong?
Aren't you going?

15:53.152 --> 15:54.921
Stop it!

15:54.921 --> 15:58.391
You should not bother
about me.

15:58.391 --> 16:02.828
Miss Akiko's life is on the line
as you stand here.

16:03.396 --> 16:06.332
I don't care as long as
my wish is granted.

16:06.332 --> 16:09.768
Miss Akiko's life and death
don't matter to me.

16:10.536 --> 16:12.939
A curse will always
come full circle.

16:12.939 --> 16:16.242
You can't escape punishment
if you curse someone.

16:16.242 --> 16:21.578
All I want is for that person
to return to my side.

16:23.082 --> 16:28.254
Hey... don't bother about
me and just leave.

16:28.254 --> 16:29.656
I can't do that!

16:29.656 --> 16:32.659
You must help Miss Keiko,
Masahiro.

16:32.659 --> 16:34.684
An onmyouji can save
people, right?

16:35.261 --> 16:37.530
This is Akiko's wish!

16:37.530 --> 16:39.332
You're stupid!

16:39.332 --> 16:42.495
I'm feeling jubilant.

16:42.535 --> 16:44.771
Why can't you understand?

16:44.771 --> 16:47.140
Everything's not real!

16:47.140 --> 16:48.937
Tenpou...

16:50.643 --> 16:52.270
Tennai...

16:53.913 --> 16:56.677
I wonder what's on
your mind.

16:57.483 --> 16:59.041
Tenshou...

17:00.019 --> 17:02.010
Don't waste your effort.

17:09.062 --> 17:10.689
Tenpo...

17:12.632 --> 17:15.658
Tenkin... Tenshin...

17:16.135 --> 17:19.272
Tenchuu... Tennin...

17:19.272 --> 17:20.899
Tenei!

17:21.674 --> 17:25.474
It's useless! I'm in control
of this territory!

17:29.849 --> 17:32.885
That's... That shape is...

17:32.885 --> 17:34.580
The Big Dipper!

17:35.621 --> 17:39.158
Pure lights in the sky,
cloudy shadows in the earth.

17:39.158 --> 17:42.889
I pray to the guardians,
pity and protect me.

17:43.596 --> 17:46.030
Do it immediately!

17:49.969 --> 17:53.206
The priest is reaching soon.

17:53.206 --> 17:56.972
Be quiet! You'll disturb
our master!

17:57.543 --> 18:00.842
That priest is quite good.

18:09.689 --> 18:11.418
Masahiro!

18:12.892 --> 18:14.883
I will never forgive you!

18:14.927 --> 18:17.030
I will never forgive you!

18:17.030 --> 18:18.564
How dare you interfere!

18:18.564 --> 18:22.068
- Guren, go to Akiko!
- What about you?

18:22.068 --> 18:25.071
Princess Keiko will die
if I leave now.

18:25.071 --> 18:27.840
Princess Keiko's vindictive
spirit is here.

18:27.840 --> 18:29.976
If I go now,

18:29.976 --> 18:32.979
the revived Kifune deity
will unleash its power.

18:32.979 --> 18:36.346
That power will be too much
for her soulless body.

18:38.017 --> 18:40.853
The evil aura that lives within
Princess Keiko...

18:40.853 --> 18:42.789
will not be exorcised
so easily.

18:42.789 --> 18:45.349
I can't leave until
that is done.

18:46.993 --> 18:49.484
Guren, take care of Akiko.

18:53.066 --> 18:55.435
- No way.
- Why?

18:55.435 --> 18:58.671
I can't possibly leave you
here in this state.

18:58.671 --> 19:02.107
Don't bother about me!
Save Akiko!

19:03.176 --> 19:06.475
- Then what should we do now?
- Seal!

19:15.688 --> 19:19.292
- I'll take it from here.
- Grandfather...

19:19.292 --> 19:22.128
Looks like you're having
some problems here.

19:22.128 --> 19:24.564
Why didn't you come earlier?

19:24.564 --> 19:26.498
Don't rely on others.

19:27.133 --> 19:29.936
You'll be duly rewarded
for your efforts.

19:29.936 --> 19:35.508
If you have tried your best,
luck will definitely come to you.

19:35.508 --> 19:38.578
Go away... you're such
a nuisance.

19:38.578 --> 19:40.842
Guren, let's go!

19:47.687 --> 19:49.555
- Seimei...
- Go.

19:49.555 --> 19:51.991
Masahiro can't handle
this alone.

19:51.991 --> 19:54.827
- And you?
- You don't have to worry.

19:54.827 --> 19:57.660
But what about
your wounds?

19:59.365 --> 20:01.094
They're nothing serious.

20:03.636 --> 20:06.764
You're too rash. Rikugou.

20:09.442 --> 20:11.811
Please help Masahiro.

20:11.811 --> 20:14.447
I'll join you once
I'm finished here.

20:14.447 --> 20:16.108
I see.

20:21.687 --> 20:24.257
You were certainly stupid,
weren't you?

20:24.257 --> 20:26.359
Allowing the demons
to trick you,

20:26.359 --> 20:28.427
and going down
a forbidden road.

20:28.427 --> 20:30.830
But you can still turn back,

20:30.830 --> 20:33.628
as Masahiro rescued you
in the nick of time.

20:37.436 --> 20:40.072
I, Seimei, will embrace
all that comes from...

20:40.072 --> 20:42.006
the heart tainted with
darkness.

20:52.952 --> 20:55.944
I see. This is good stuff.

20:57.190 --> 21:00.026
An injury that doesn't heal...
A permanent injury...

21:00.026 --> 21:03.095
An indication of prey.

21:03.095 --> 21:06.432
Let's get the priest here
and kill him.

21:06.432 --> 21:08.957
We can steal his spiritual
power then.

21:14.540 --> 21:16.303
It's over there!

21:19.512 --> 21:22.310
Wait for us, Akiko!

21:42.802 --> 21:54.180
Fukai yami no naka de
kimi no koe ga kikoeta

21:54.180 --> 22:05.558
"Shinjiteru" tada hitokoto
boku no kokoro ni hibiite kita

22:05.558 --> 22:11.297
Itsumo kimi ga soba ni
ite kureta ne

22:11.297 --> 22:17.031
Itsumo boku ni
yuuki kurete ita

22:19.305 --> 22:29.615
Boku-tachi no mirai wo
mamoritsuzukeru tame ni

22:29.615 --> 22:36.355
Taisetsu na kimi ni
yakusokusuru yo

22:36.355 --> 22:41.627
Boku wa akiramenai

22:41.627 --> 22:47.300
Motto motto boku
wa boku wo koete

22:47.300 --> 22:53.899
Kitto kitto kitto

22:59.979 --> 23:02.539
Next Episode

23:24.270 --> 23:25.871
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.871 --> 23:26.806
Episode 9.

23:26.806 --> 23:27.106
Episode 9
Crush the Curse of Darkness
Episode 9.

23:27.106 --> 23:29.141
Episode 9
Crush the Curse of Darkness
Crush the Curse of Darkness.
